From ada5fbf59272fdc02e3e08cd378a80f91f2002ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hans-Christoph Steiner <hans@eds.org>
Date: Tue, 24 Sep 2019 15:36:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/20] add Java Native Interface (JNI) API to support Android

Based mostly on @sysrqb's work aka TorApi.

The autotools stuff is based on:
https://www.gnu.org/software/autoconf-archive/ax_jni_include_dir.html
---
